{"seq":2,"slug":"chart-types","title":"图表类型：柱状/折线/散点/热力图/桑基图的适用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/chart-types","wordCount":1764,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"图表类型-柱状-折线-散点-热力图-桑基图的适用场景\">图表类型：柱状/折线/散点/热力图/桑基图的适用场景</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>柱状图</strong>：用柱体长度编码数值，最适合类别比较，Y 轴必须从零开始</li>\n<li><strong>折线图</strong>：用连续线条展示时间趋势，是时间序列分析的核心，Y 轴可以不从零开始</li>\n<li><strong>散点图</strong>：用两个轴的位置编码两个连续变量，用于探索相关性、聚类与异常；气泡图可编码第三维</li>\n<li><strong>热力图</strong>：用颜色编码矩阵单元格数值，适合两个分类变量交叉的分布（留存矩阵、活跃时段）</li>\n<li><strong>桑基图</strong>：用流线宽度展示节点间的流向与流量，是用户路径分析与渠道归因的最佳图表</li>\n<li><strong>统计图表</strong>：箱线图以五数概括比较多组分布，直方图通过分桶统计频次展示分布形态</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础图表类型\">基础图表类型</h2><h3 id=\"柱状图-bar-chart\">柱状图（Bar Chart）</h3><p>柱状图是最基础也最常用的图表类型，通过柱体的长度编码数据的大小，适合比较不同类别的数值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[柱状图变体] --&gt; B[垂直柱状图]&#10;    A --&gt; C[水平条形图]&#10;    A --&gt; D[分组柱状图]&#10;    A --&gt; E[堆叠柱状图]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[类别少于 7 个]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[类别名称较长]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[多组数据对比]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[展示部分与整体]\">graph TD\n    A[柱状图变体] --&gt; B[垂直柱状图]\n    A --&gt; C[水平条形图]\n    A --&gt; D[分组柱状图]\n    A --&gt; E[堆叠柱状图]\n    B --&gt; B1[类别少于 7 个]\n    C --&gt; C1[类别名称较长]\n    D --&gt; D1[多组数据对比]\n    E --&gt; E1[展示部分与整体]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>柱状图变体</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础柱状图</td>\n<td>单维度数据比较</td>\n<td>Y 轴从零开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水平条形图</td>\n<td>类别标签长、类别多</td>\n<td>按数值排序提升可读性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组柱状图</td>\n<td>2-3 组数据的多类别对比</td>\n<td>组数不超过 3 组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堆叠柱状图</td>\n<td>展示各部分在整体中的占比</td>\n<td>颜色数不超过 5 种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百分比堆叠</td>\n<td>仅关注比例而非绝对值</td>\n<td>无法比较绝对值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瀑布图</td>\n<td>展示增减过程（如财务变化）</td>\n<td>明确标注正负方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成柱状图数据：各产品类别月度销售额&#10;SELECT&#10;    product_category,&#10;    DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date) AS month,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE order_date &gt;= &#39;2025-01-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY product_category, DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date)&#10;ORDER BY month, revenue DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成柱状图数据：各产品类别月度销售额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product_category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_category, DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, revenue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"折线图-line-chart\">折线图（Line Chart）</h3><p>折线图通过连续的线条展示数据随时间的变化趋势，是时间序列分析中最核心的图表类型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>折线图变体</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础折线图</td>\n<td>单指标趋势</td>\n<td>数据点不宜过密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多系列折线图</td>\n<td>多指标趋势对比</td>\n<td>系列数不超过 5 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积图</td>\n<td>强调趋势下方的累积量</td>\n<td>透明度避免遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堆叠面积图</td>\n<td>展示各部分随时间的占比变化</td>\n<td>排序稳定避免视觉混乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯线图</td>\n<td>离散变化（如价格调整）</td>\n<td>数据变化不连续时使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成折线图数据：DAU 趋势（含 7 日移动平均）&#10;SELECT&#10;    DATE(event_time) AS date,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS dau,&#10;    AVG(COUNT(DISTINCT user_id)) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY DATE(event_time)&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS dau_7d_avg&#10;FROM user_events&#10;WHERE event_time &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY DATE(event_time)&#10;ORDER BY date;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成折线图数据：DAU 趋势（含 7 日移动平均）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dau,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dau_7d_avg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>折线图的关键设计决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Y 轴起点</td>\n<td>可以不从零开始（与柱状图不同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据点标记</td>\n<td>数据点稀疏时显示，密集时隐藏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失值处理</td>\n<td>断开线条或使用虚线连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趋势线</td>\n<td>需要时添加移动平均或回归线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标注</td>\n<td>对异常点或关键事件添加文字标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"高级图表类型\">高级图表类型</h2><h3 id=\"散点图-scatter-plot\">散点图（Scatter Plot）</h3><p>散点图通过两个轴的位置编码两个连续变量的值，用于探索变量之间的关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[散点图用途] --&gt; B[相关性分析]&#10;    A --&gt; C[聚类发现]&#10;    A --&gt; D[异常检测]&#10;    A --&gt; E[多维数据探索]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[正相关/负相关/无相关]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[自然分群]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[偏离主群的数据点]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[气泡大小编码第三维]\">graph TD\n    A[散点图用途] --&gt; B[相关性分析]\n    A --&gt; C[聚类发现]\n    A --&gt; D[异常检测]\n    A --&gt; E[多维数据探索]\n    B --&gt; B1[正相关/负相关/无相关]\n    C --&gt; C1[自然分群]\n    D --&gt; D1[偏离主群的数据点]\n    E --&gt; E1[气泡大小编码第三维]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>散点图变体</th>\n<th>编码维度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础散点图</td>\n<td>2 维</td>\n<td>两变量关系分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气泡图</td>\n<td>3 维</td>\n<td>增加大小维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色散点图</td>\n<td>3 维</td>\n<td>增加分类维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气泡+颜色</td>\n<td>4 维</td>\n<td>多维关系探索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵散点图</td>\n<td>N 维</td>\n<td>多变量两两关系全览</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成散点图数据：用户活跃度与消费金额的关系&#10;SELECT&#10;    u.user_id,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(e.event_time)) AS active_days,&#10;    COALESCE(SUM(o.amount), 0) AS total_spending,&#10;    u.registration_source AS channel&#10;FROM users u&#10;LEFT JOIN user_events e ON u.user_id = e.user_id&#10;    AND e.event_time &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;LEFT JOIN orders o ON u.user_id = o.user_id&#10;    AND o.order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY u.user_id, u.registration_source;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成散点图数据：用户活跃度与消费金额的关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spending,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"热力图-heatmap\">热力图（Heatmap）</h3><p>热力图使用颜色编码矩阵中每个单元格的数值，适合展示两个分类变量交叉下的数值分布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>热力图变体</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矩阵热力图</td>\n<td>两个分类维度的数值分布</td>\n<td>留存矩阵、相关矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日历热力图</td>\n<td>日级别的时间分布</td>\n<td>GitHub 贡献图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时段热力图</td>\n<td>时间×维度的分布模式</td>\n<td>一周内各时段活跃度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理热力图</td>\n<td>地理位置的数值密度</td>\n<td>用户分布地图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成热力图数据：每周各时段的用户活跃度&#10;SELECT&#10;    EXTRACT(DOW FROM event_time) AS day_of_week,&#10;    EXTRACT(HOUR FROM event_time) AS hour_of_day,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS active_users&#10;FROM user_events&#10;WHERE event_time &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY EXTRACT(DOW FROM event_time), EXTRACT(HOUR FROM event_time)&#10;ORDER BY day_of_week, hour_of_day;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成热力图数据：每周各时段的用户活跃度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(DOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day_of_week,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HOUR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hour_of_day,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTRACT(DOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time), EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HOUR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> day_of_week, hour_of_day;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"桑基图-sankey-diagram\">桑基图（Sankey Diagram）</h3><p>桑基图通过流线的宽度展示数据在不同节点之间的流向和流量，适合展示转化路径和分流情况。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[首页 1000] --&gt;|600| B[商品列表]&#10;    A --&gt;|300| C[搜索]&#10;    A --&gt;|100| D[个人中心]&#10;    B --&gt;|400| E[商品详情]&#10;    C --&gt;|200| E&#10;    E --&gt;|300| F[加购]&#10;    F --&gt;|180| G[支付成功]\">graph LR\n    A[首页 1000] --&gt;|600| B[商品列表]\n    A --&gt;|300| C[搜索]\n    A --&gt;|100| D[个人中心]\n    B --&gt;|400| E[商品详情]\n    C --&gt;|200| E\n    E --&gt;|300| F[加购]\n    F --&gt;|180| G[支付成功]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>桑基图适用场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户路径分析</td>\n<td>展示用户在产品中的真实行为路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道归因</td>\n<td>展示不同渠道到转化的贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能源流向</td>\n<td>展示资源从源头到终端的分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算分配</td>\n<td>展示资金在不同科目间的流转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户分群流转</td>\n<td>展示用户在不同状态之间的迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成桑基图数据：用户页面流转&#10;WITH page_sequences AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        user_id,&#10;        session_id,&#10;        page_name AS current_page,&#10;        LEAD(page_name) OVER (&#10;            PARTITION BY user_id, session_id ORDER BY event_time&#10;        ) AS next_page&#10;    FROM page_view_events&#10;    WHERE DATE(event_time) = &#39;2025-03-01&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;    current_page AS source,&#10;    next_page AS target,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS flow_count&#10;FROM page_sequences&#10;WHERE next_page IS NOT NULL&#10;GROUP BY current_page, next_page&#10;ORDER BY flow_count DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成桑基图数据：用户页面流转</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_sequences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        session_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        page_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_page,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        LEAD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page_name) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id, session_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_view_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event_time) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current_page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    next_page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flow_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page_sequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_page </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_page, next_page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flow_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"统计图表类型\">统计图表类型</h2><h3 id=\"箱线图-box-plot\">箱线图（Box Plot）</h3><p>箱线图展示数据分布的五数概括（最小值、Q1、中位数、Q3、最大值），适合比较多组数据的分布特征。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>箱线图元素</th>\n<th>统计含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>箱体下边</td>\n<td>第一四分位数（Q1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>箱体内线</td>\n<td>中位数（Q2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>箱体上边</td>\n<td>第三四分位数（Q3）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>须线</td>\n<td>1.5 × IQR 范围内的极值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离群点</td>\n<td>超出须线范围的数据点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成箱线图数据：各渠道用户的订单金额分布&#10;SELECT&#10;    u.registration_source AS channel,&#10;    o.amount,&#10;    PERCENTILE_CONT(0.25) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY o.amount)&#10;        OVER (PARTITION BY u.registration_source) AS q1,&#10;    PERCENTILE_CONT(0.50) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY o.amount)&#10;        OVER (PARTITION BY u.registration_source) AS median,&#10;    PERCENTILE_CONT(0.75) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY o.amount)&#10;        OVER (PARTITION BY u.registration_source) AS q3&#10;FROM orders o&#10;JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成箱线图数据：各渠道用户的订单金额分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"直方图-histogram\">直方图（Histogram）</h3><p>直方图将连续数据分桶后统计频次，展示数据的分布形态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成直方图数据：订单金额分布&#10;WITH buckets AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        WIDTH_BUCKET(amount, 0, 1000, 20) AS bucket_id,&#10;        COUNT(*) AS frequency&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    WHERE amount BETWEEN 0 AND 1000&#10;    GROUP BY WIDTH_BUCKET(amount, 0, 1000, 20)&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;    (bucket_id - 1) * 50 AS range_start,&#10;    bucket_id * 50 AS range_end,&#10;    frequency&#10;FROM buckets&#10;ORDER BY bucket_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成直方图数据：订单金额分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buckets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        WIDTH_BUCKET(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frequency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WIDTH_BUCKET(amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (bucket_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> range_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bucket_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> range_end,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    frequency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buckets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"图表选择参考矩阵\">图表选择参考矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析需求</th>\n<th>首选图表</th>\n<th>备选图表</th>\n<th>避免使用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类别数值比较</td>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n<td>条形图、点图</td>\n<td>饼图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间趋势</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n<td>面积图</td>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分占整体</td>\n<td>堆叠柱状图</td>\n<td>树图、饼图</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两变量关系</td>\n<td>散点图</td>\n<td>气泡图</td>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频次分布</td>\n<td>直方图</td>\n<td>密度图、箱线图</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多组分布比较</td>\n<td>箱线图</td>\n<td>小提琴图</td>\n<td>柱状图（均值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵数值</td>\n<td>热力图</td>\n<td>气泡矩阵</td>\n<td>多系列折线图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流向关系</td>\n<td>桑基图</td>\n<td>和弦图</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级结构</td>\n<td>树图</td>\n<td>旭日图</td>\n<td>表格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理分布</td>\n<td>地图</td>\n<td>等值域图</td>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多指标雷达</td>\n<td>雷达图</td>\n<td>平行坐标图</td>\n<td>多系列柱状图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图表组合策略\">图表组合策略</h2><h3 id=\"组合图-combo-chart\">组合图（Combo Chart）</h3><p>在同一个坐标系中叠加不同类型的图表，适合展示相关但量纲不同的指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>常见组合</th>\n<th>主图表</th>\n<th>叠加图表</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>柱+折</td>\n<td>柱状图</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n<td>销售额（柱）+ 增长率（折线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面积+折</td>\n<td>面积图</td>\n<td>折线图</td>\n<td>总量（面积）+ 移动平均（折线）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>散点+趋势线</td>\n<td>散点图</td>\n<td>回归线</td>\n<td>数据分布 + 拟合趋势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"小倍数-small-multiples\">小倍数（Small Multiples）</h3><p>将数据按某个维度拆分为多个小图表，保持相同的坐标轴和比例尺，便于跨组比较。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成小倍数数据：按渠道拆分的每日转化率&#10;SELECT&#10;    registration_source AS channel,&#10;    DATE(order_date) AS date,&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN status = &#39;completed&#39; THEN order_id END)::NUMERIC&#10;        / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT order_id), 0) * 100 AS conversion_rate&#10;FROM orders o&#10;JOIN users u ON o.user_id = u.user_id&#10;WHERE order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY registration_source, DATE(order_date)&#10;ORDER BY channel, date;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成小倍数数据：按渠道拆分的每日转化率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    registration_source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conversion_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registration_source, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>柱状图最适合类别比较，Y 轴必须从零开始；折线图最适合时间趋势，Y 轴可以不从零开始</li>\n<li>散点图揭示两个连续变量的关系，气泡图可以编码第三个维度</li>\n<li>热力图适合展示两个分类变量交叉的数值分布，如留存矩阵和活跃时段分布</li>\n<li>桑基图展示数据的流向和流量，是用户路径分析的最佳图表类型</li>\n<li>图表选择应基于分析目标而非美观偏好，复杂场景可使用组合图或小倍数</li>\n<li>单张图表中系列数不超过 5 条、颜色不超过 7 种、分类不超过 10 个</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图表类型：柱状/折线/散点/热力图/桑基图的适用场景","id":"图表类型-柱状-折线-散点-热力图-桑基图的适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础图表类型","id":"基础图表类型"},{"level":3,"text":"柱状图（Bar Chart）","id":"柱状图-bar-chart"},{"level":3,"text":"折线图（Line Chart）","id":"折线图-line-chart"},{"level":2,"text":"高级图表类型","id":"高级图表类型"},{"level":3,"text":"散点图（Scatter Plot）","id":"散点图-scatter-plot"},{"level":3,"text":"热力图（Heatmap）","id":"热力图-heatmap"},{"level":3,"text":"桑基图（Sankey Diagram）","id":"桑基图-sankey-diagram"},{"level":2,"text":"统计图表类型","id":"统计图表类型"},{"level":3,"text":"箱线图（Box Plot）","id":"箱线图-box-plot"},{"level":3,"text":"直方图（Histogram）","id":"直方图-histogram"},{"level":2,"text":"图表选择参考矩阵","id":"图表选择参考矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"图表组合策略","id":"图表组合策略"},{"level":3,"text":"组合图（Combo Chart）","id":"组合图-combo-chart"},{"level":3,"text":"小倍数（Small Multiples）","id":"小倍数-small-multiples"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可视化原则：Edward Tufte 原则、数据墨水比、图表选择决策树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/visualization-principles"},"next":{"title":"仪表盘设计：布局原则、信息密度、交互设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-visualization/dashboard-design"}}